          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_plunder_gu",
          "gu_rice_bag_grass_gu",
          "gu_charred_thunder_potato_mother_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing wants the rank three grass Gu, requests it, and refines it as her lifebound Gu. When she returns to the cave she wears a thistle shirt of green vines and black sharp thorns, formed by Iron Thorn Thistle Gu, that gives defense and can also attack; the thorns are as sturdy as steel against barehanded fighters.",
        "chapters": [
          212
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
